Third-party notices (not covered by the MIT license above):

- This repository contains no model weights. The ML models used at runtime
  (Gemma by Google, whisper by OpenAI/ONNX-community builds, Phonon by
  Gradium, voices from gradium/phonon-voices and the public multilingual
  mirror by empyrealworks) are downloaded by the visitor's browser directly
  from Hugging Face or a URL configured in the app, and are governed by their
  own licenses (Gemma Terms of Use, Apache-2.0, CC BY-NC 4.0 respectively).
  Anyone redistributing those files must follow those licenses and credit
  the sources — see "Where the Phonon model files come from" in the README.
- src/data/deu-rus.json is an offline German→Russian dictionary (26k
  entries), derived from FreeDict deu-rus
  (https://download.freedict.org/dictionaries/deu-rus/), built by
  backend/scripts/build_dict.py in the native version. FreeDict dictionaries
  are released under GPL-2.0-or-later / CC BY-SA by their contributors; this
  derived data file keeps that license — the MIT license above applies to
  the application code only.
